{
  "_readme": [
    "Careless bot (meridianEvPANDA architecture, Careless strategy). Copy to user-config.json and edit; restart after changes.",
    "shadowMode: true forces DRY_RUN (nothing is submitted); every would-be entry becomes a paper position (node cli.js paper). Set false only after reviewing paper results.",
    "Secrets go in .env, never here: RPC_URL, WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY, TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN, GMGN_API_KEY.",
    "Sizing: maxPositions \u00d7 deployAmountSol (Careless works best with many small positions). maxDeployAmount caps compounding.",
    "Deploy gates (minTvl, maxTvl, minBinStep, maxBinStep, timeframe, minFeeActiveTvlRatio) are re-checked by the executor right before every deploy; keep them at least as loose as careless.pool.",
    "careless.*: every key is optional; see buildCarelessConfig in config.js for all defaults."
  ],
